{"version":1,"content":"<p>「香港美酒佳餚巡禮2026」（Wine &amp; Dine 2026）於10月29日至11月1日在中環海濱活動空間及添馬公園舉行。</p><p>今屆活動以「品味世界之最」為主題，首設品酒導賞。</p><p>愛品酒之人固然可一試世界各地不同產區的美酒，不喝酒的訪客亦可在添馬公園咖啡園歎精品咖啡及特色飲品。</p><p>【活動詳情】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:41:33.031191+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:07:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:38:07.775401+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:14.606228+00:00","content_hash":"5b5624f84013dfe50692fd151148e199d2ccd7309d56a99d756fe4769243d30d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}